OL,3,GNEWSAPink suitcase examined in bin bag
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating whether a pink
OL,7,Fsuitcase found in a Liverpool park is
OL,8,Flinked to the discovery of a woman's
OL,9,Fbody in a bin bag there two weeks ago.
OL,11,FA murder investigation was launched
OL,12,Fafter the body of a woman, aged about
OL,13,F70, was found in a walled garden near
OL,14,FIsla Gladstone Conservatory in Stanley
OL,15,FPark, Anfield, at about 17:25 BST on 28
OL,16,FAugust.
OL,18,FMerseyside Police confirmed a pink
OL,19,Fsuitcase recovered from the park was
OL,20,Fbeing examined to determine if it was
OL,21,Frelevant to the investigation.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
