OL,3,GNEWSAPink suitcase examined in bin bag
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo weeks on, the force has renewed an
OL,7,Fappeal to identify the woman and
OL,8,Fconfirmed it was liaising with other
OL,9,Fpolice forces in the UK and
OL,10,Finternationally.
